    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Nowhere Tech, transfer student- where you'll meet people, make choices, make mistakes, and make even more mistakes. You came here to have new experiences and live a little, but you might get more than you bargained for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate this choice-heavy, dialogue-heavy\u00a0story and crack the code behind your enigmatic new classmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCLUDING:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- TWO semi-dateable beautiful young women!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 major linear endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Countless possible diverging routes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlockable images and special events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Surprise gameplay at the most inopportune time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warnings:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursing, discussion of sexual themes, drug references- typical college life stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any resemblance of characters, events, or themes to real people in my life\u00a0is unintended. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Nowhere Tech, transfer student- where you'll meet people, make choices, make mistakes, and make even more mistakes. You came here to have new experiences and live a little, but you might get more than you bargained for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate this choice-heavy, dialogue-heavy\u00a0story and crack the code behind your enigmatic new classmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCLUDING:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- TWO semi-dateable beautiful young women!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 major linear endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Countless possible diverging routes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlockable images and special events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Surprise gameplay at the most inopportune time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warnings:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursing, discussion of sexual themes, drug references- typical college life stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any resemblance of characters, events, or themes to real people in my life\u00a0is unintended. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
